	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Salus in Iesu Christo, qui vera et unica salus est.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Reverende vir, non possum <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>mihi temperare, quin nacto grammatophoro nonnihil ad humanitatem tuam <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>scribam, idque partim, ut amorem meum erga te contester, partim ut memoriam <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>mei apud te reficiam.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Mirum in modum ingratus ergo sim, si in oblivia abire paterer <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>tuam erga me humanitatem comitatemque, et est, quod te deamem ob peramica <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>adeoque fraterna beneficia, que olim expertus sum in rerum mearum undis.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale in Christo <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>salvatore una cum familia tua quam foelicissime.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Raptim ocyssime <placeName ref="l18">Auguste</placeName> 6. octobris <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>anno 1557.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z9"/><persName>Chrystophero</persName> nostro dedi 1 fl. pro pyreto novo, 1 fl. pro calceis et nonullis (sic?) baciis, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>quos debuit matri suę familias, item 1 fl. pro restaurandis caligis, facit 2 fl.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Hec autem non scribo exigende pecunie caussa, sed ut cognoscas, quam difficile sit eciam <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>iuveni hic in tanta penuria rerum <placeName ref="l18">Auguste</placeName> habitare.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Iterum vale et salutabis mihi <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>totam familiam tuam, omnes bonos, precipue hospitem meum d. <persName ref="p8171">Theodorum Bibliandrum</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>cum tota sua familia.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Ex animo tuus d(e)d(itu<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>s), <persName ref="p1000">I[oannes] Ehingerus</persName>.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de">Von dem, was zuͦ <persName>Sanct Quintin</persName> geschehen ist, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>desgleichen von dem grossen gewesser zu <placeName ref="l425">Rom</placeName> und <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>zu <placeName ref="l1098">Florentz</placeName>, was für grossen schaden getan hab, versich <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ich mich, ir habet des ebenso gut wissen als mir hie.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Multa pietate, eximia eruditione et <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>syncera doctrina prestantissimo domino <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><persName ref="p495">Heinrico Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinensis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ecclesiae pastori vigilantissimo dignissimoque, <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>domino atque patrono suo observandissimo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
